# legacy/ is git-ignored (each keeps its own repo), so graphify has to be told
# explicitly what to do with it.
#
# hub-cloudflare is now fully ported into packages/ and apps/. Indexing it too
# would double every symbol and send queries to the dead copy — `mirzabotVerify`
# should resolve to packages/domain/src, not to legacy. Excluded.
#
# mirzabot-php stays indexed: it is the behavioural reference for the bot we are
# about to rewrite in phase 4, and nothing has replaced it yet.

node_modules/
dist/
build/
graphify-out/

legacy/hub-cloudflare/

legacy/mirzabot-php/vendor/
legacy/mirzabot-php/lang/
